{
  "name": "Optiquity content pipeline — POLL (render)",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## POLL flow — the always-works baseline\n\nDrives the optiquity-content-pipeline HTTP shim with **no inbound reachability** required, so it works from **localhost / LAN / self-hosted** n8n.\n\n**Before you run:**\n1. Create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential — Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer <SHIM_SECRET>` (or Name `X-API-Key`, Value `<SHIM_SECRET>`) — and select it on every HTTP Request node here.\n2. Replace `<WORKSPACE>`, `<USER>` (the §23 isolation prefix the shim requires, parallel to workspace), `<ZONE>` (the §23/Z4 isolation zone — `default` if you have not carved zones), and `<ARTIFACT_ID>` in **Submit render** — the same `<USER>` and `<ZONE>` are reused on **Poll job**. The base URL `http://127.0.0.1:8787` is the shim's loopback default; change it if you bind elsewhere behind a proxy.\n\nThe Tier-B verb is `render` (token-free / content-addressed): a retry collides on the same job key with no session handshake.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky: how to use",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### render returns 200 OR 202\n**200** = sync cache-hit / fast local serialize → `body.results` is already here.\n**202** = accepted → keep `body.job.key` + `body.job.target_ids` and poll.\nA caller MUST handle both — do not assume 202.\n\nA **400** `render-blocked` (bad coordinates) surfaces `body.block` — inspect it if neither branch fires.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Sticky: 200 vs 202",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        360,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### /poll states\n**200 done** → `body.results`.\n**202 running** → wait and poll again.\nElse the job **failed / re-drivable** (409/429/504): read `body.code` and `body.redrivable`; re-submit with the same request (or the same `idempotency_key`) to re-drive.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Sticky: poll states",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1160,
        620
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/invoke",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"verb\": \"render\",\n  \"workspace\": \"<WORKSPACE>\",\n  \"user\": \"<USER>\",\n  \"zone\": \"<ZONE>\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"item\": \"<ARTIFACT_ID>\",\n    \"platform\": \"linkedin\",\n    \"language\": \"en\",\n    \"output_type\": \"docx\",\n    \"presentation\": \"plain\"\n  }\n}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Submit render",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        280,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Optiquity Shim Header Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode }}",
              "rightValue": 200,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Sync cache-hit?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 5,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Wait between polls",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        760,
        420
      ],
      "webhookId": "d4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/poll",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"workspace\": \"<WORKSPACE>\",\n  \"user\": \"<USER>\",\n  \"zone\": \"<ZONE>\",\n  \"key\": \"{{ $('Submit render').item.json.body.job.key }}\",\n  \"target_ids\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Submit render').item.json.body.job.target_ids) }}\n}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Poll job",
